<title>PORTUGAL: BCP, BPI hold 11 pct Cimpor - paper.</title>
<headline>BCP, BPI hold 11 pct Cimpor - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese banking groups Banco Comercial Portugues and Banco Portugues de Investimento hold about 11 percent of the capital of cement group Cimpor, Cimpor president Antonio Sousa Gomes was quoted as saying.</p>
<p>The holding is managed by various investment funds administered by the two banking groups, he told Diario Economico newspaper.</p>
</text>
